    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, upgrade filled, adventure that goes from curious kitty to unstoppable leaf-crunching beast.\u00a0 Stomp, explore, and uncover cozy forest secrets with your magical fairy guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time your triple stomps to the music for a special attack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.poster.avif?t=1755629182\" aria-label=\"Time your triple stomps to the music for a special attack\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.webm?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.mp4?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect hidden treasures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.poster.avif?t=1755629182\" aria-label=\"Collect hidden treasures\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.webm?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.mp4?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive wild winds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.poster.avif?t=1755629182\" aria-label=\"Survive wild winds\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.webm?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.mp4?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.poster.avif?t=1755629182\" aria-label=\"Customize your character\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.webm?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.mp4?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Cozy Crunch</strong> is a gentle, whimsical adventure where you guide a curious cat through a crunchy leaf-filled forest using a magical fairy (your mouse cursor). Stomp leaves, uncover secrets, and explore hand-crafted areas filled with cozy atmosphere and charming surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple point and click controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 hand crafted areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden rhythm mechanic - time your triple stomps to the music to unleash powerful waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization (50+ variations)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple progression paths with quests, hidden items, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Duration</strong>: ~3-4+ hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong><i>Cozy Crunch</i></strong> and prepare to leaf your worries behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I\u2019m Jo, a solo indie developer, and this is my first game. Cozy Crunch is inspired by the charm of classic online flash games. Simple, relaxing, and designed to be enjoyed in a single cozy evening. I hope it brings you a bit of calm and delight, just like it did for me while creating it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, upgrade filled, adventure that goes from curious kitty to unstoppable leaf-crunching beast.\u00a0 Stomp, explore, and uncover cozy forest secrets with your magical fairy guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time your triple stomps to the music for a special attack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.poster.avif?t=1755629182\" aria-label=\"Time your triple stomps to the music for a special attack\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.webm?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.mp4?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect hidden treasures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.poster.avif?t=1755629182\" aria-label=\"Collect hidden treasures\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.webm?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.mp4?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive wild winds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.poster.avif?t=1755629182\" aria-label=\"Survive wild winds\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.webm?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.mp4?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.poster.avif?t=1755629182\" aria-label=\"Customize your character\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.webm?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.mp4?t=1755629182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Cozy Crunch</strong> is a gentle, whimsical adventure where you guide a curious cat through a crunchy leaf-filled forest using a magical fairy (your mouse cursor). Stomp leaves, uncover secrets, and explore hand-crafted areas filled with cozy atmosphere and charming surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple point and click controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 hand crafted areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden rhythm mechanic - time your triple stomps to the music to unleash powerful waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization (50+ variations)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple progression paths with quests, hidden items, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Duration</strong>: ~3-4+ hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong><i>Cozy Crunch</i></strong> and prepare to leaf your worries behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I\u2019m Jo, a solo indie developer, and this is my first game. Cozy Crunch is inspired by the charm of classic online flash games. Simple, relaxing, and designed to be enjoyed in a single cozy evening. I hope it brings you a bit of calm and delight, just like it did for me while creating it.</p>",
